ged boot ID `9a95a1a9-…`, and successful post-restart backup recovery."},{"requirement":"node2 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-af4682eeb748430e","cmd-2003a1f840b94a6b","cmd-6ac8f9c7d7904be6","cmd-d578b9eb41c7490b","cmd-7a4336b55a29459e"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID `0571f4dd-…`, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot ID `fdbee2b4-…`, restored SSH/export state, and successful end-to-end backup after recovery."}]}
